# AI development

- Store prompts as versioned files under `backend/app/ai/prompts/{version}/`.
- Bump or document `AI_PROMPT_VERSION` when prompt behavior changes.
- Use structured Pydantic schemas for machine-readable outputs where appropriate.
- Extend `ai-evals/datasets` and regression tests — do not hard-code fake eval scores.
- Log model id and prompt version metadata; avoid logging full user content in production.
- Document retrieval/index changes in PR template sections.
